<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dev Labs | Next-Gen Multi-Dimensional Web Agency</title>
    <style>
        /* --- CORE CONFIGURATION & NEON THEME --- */
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #04040a;
            --bg-cards: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --border-glow: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
            --neon-cyan: #00f2fe;
            --neon-blue: #4facfe;
            --neon-purple: #7f00ff;
            --neon-green: #00ff87;
            --text-pure: #ffffff;
            --text-dim: #94a3b8;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-pure);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            perspective: 1000px;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Fixed Background Canvas mapping across the entire website height */
        #spatial-canvas {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #0a0a16 0%, #04040a 100%);
        }

        /* --- NAVIGATION BAR --- */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 5%;
            background: rgba(4, 4, 10, 0.9);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .logo-space {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-blue));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-cyan);
        }

        /* --- GLOBAL LAYOUT STRUCTURE --- */
        section {
            padding: 100px 5% 60px;
            position: relative;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .section-header {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #aaa 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .section-header p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- SECTION 1: HOME --- */
        #home {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 120px 5% 60px;
        }

        .hero-cube {
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
            max-width: 900px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        #home h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.2;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 40%, #4facfe 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        #home p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .action-hub {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .btn-prime {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-cyan));
            color: #000;
            padding: 15px 35px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .btn-prime:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 50px var(--neon-cyan);
        }

        /* --- SECTION 2: ABOUT US & TECH STACK --- */
        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-text {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .about-text p {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .tech-stack {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .tech-badges {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .badge {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .about-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .stat-box {
            background: var(--bg-cards);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 30px 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .stat-box:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
            background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.03);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
        }

        .stat-box h3 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .stat-box p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        /* --- SECTION 3: OUR PROCESS --- */
        .process-flow {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .process-step {
            background: var(--bg-cards);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 35px 25px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .process-step:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-purple);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(127, 0, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .step-num {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-purple), var(--neon-blue));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            position: absolute;
            top: -15px;
            left: 20px;
            opacity: 0.25;
        }

        .process-step h4 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .process-step p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- SECTION 4: PORTFOLIO --- */
        .portfolio-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: var(--bg-cards);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .project-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(79, 172, 254, 0.2);
        }

        .project-img-holder {
            height: 200px;
            position: relative;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .project-img-holder img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .project-card:hover .project-img-holder img {
            transform: scale(1.08);
        }

        .project-info {
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .project-info h4 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .project-info p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .project-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--neon-blue);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* --- SECTION: EID EXCLUSIVE DISPLAY --- */
        .eid-exclusive-container {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.02);
            border-top: 1px dashed rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.2);
            border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.2);
        }

        .eid-exclusive-container .section-header h2 {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--neon-green) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .eid-showcase-card {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.08), rgba(4, 4, 10, 0.8));
            border: 2px solid var(--neon-green);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .eid-showcase-card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.2);
        }

        .eid-floating-tag {
            position: absolute;
            top: -15px;
            left: 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #00b4db, var(--neon-green));
            color: #000;
            padding: 6px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.4);
        }

        .eid-left-panel h3 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 30%, var(--neon-green) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .eid-left-panel p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .eid-price-display {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .eid-price-tag {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--neon-green);
            text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.3);
        }

        .eid-price-sub {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-decoration: line-through;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        .eid-right-panel {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.15);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .eid-blueprint-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .eid-blueprint-list li {
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .eid-blueprint-list li::before {
            content: '🌙';
            margin-right: 12px;
            color: var(--neon-green);
        }

        .eid-action-btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-green), #00f2fe);
            color: #000;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.2);
        }

        .eid-action-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px var(--neon-green);
        }

        /* --- SECTION 5: SERVICES & PACKAGES --- */
        .cards-matrix {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .tilt-card {
            background: var(--bg-cards);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px 25px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .tilt-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(79, 172, 254, 0.2);
        }

        .tilt-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .pkg-price {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .feature-blueprint {
            list-style: none;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .feature-blueprint li {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .feature-blueprint li::before {
            content: '⚡';
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .pkg-btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: var(--text-pure);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .tilt-card.prime-tier {
            border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
            background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.02);
        }

        .tilt-card.prime-tier .pkg-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-cyan));
            color: #000;
            border: none;
        }

        /* --- SECTION 6: TESTIMONIALS --- */
        .reviews-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .review-card {
            background: var(--bg-cards);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .review-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
        }

        .review-card p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-style: italic;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .client-info h5 {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .client-info span {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
        }

        /* --- SECTION 7: CONTACT US --- */
        .contact-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .contact-intel {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .intel-card {
            background: var(--bg-cards);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .intel-card h4 {
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .intel-card p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .contact-form {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .form-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(4, 4, 10, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
        }

        textarea.form-control {
            resize: none;
            height: 120px;
        }

        .submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-cyan));
            color: #000;
            border: none;
            padding: 16px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--neon-cyan);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* --- FOOTER --- */
        footer {
            padding: 40px 5%;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* --- MOBILE & TABLET RESPONSIVENESS CONTROLLER --- */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .portfolio-grid, .reviews-grid, .cards-matrix { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .process-flow { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
            .about-grid, .contact-layout, .eid-showcase-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav { padding: 15px 4%; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; text-align: center; position: absolute; }
            .nav-links { flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; }
            section { padding: 80px 4% 40px; }
            .section-header h2 { font-size: 2rem; }
            #home { padding-top: 160px; }
            #home h1 { font-size: 2.3rem; }
            #home p { font-size: 1rem; }
            .portfolio-grid, .reviews-grid, .process-flow, .cards-matrix, .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .about-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .eid-showcase-card { padding: 30px 20px; }
            .eid-left-panel h3 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
            .eid-price-tag { font-size: 3rem; }
            .contact-form { padding: 20px; }
            .eid-floating-tag { left: 15px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <canvas id="spatial-canvas"></canvas>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo-space">DEV LABS</div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#home" class="active">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About Us</a></li>
            <li><a href="#process">Our Process</a></li>
            <li><a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a></li>
            <li><a href="#services">Packages</a></li>
            <li><a href="#reviews">Reviews</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <section id="home">
        <div class="hero-cube" id="dynamic-hero">
            <h1>Immersive Digital Spaces<br>Built For The Next Era</h1>
            <p>Welcome to Dev Labs. We engineer premium interactive websites, spatial interfaces, and secure digital architectures that convert occasional visitors into lifetime dedicated enterprise clients.</p>
            <div class="action-hub">
                <a href="#services" class="btn-prime">Explore Packages</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="btn-prime" style="background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan); color: #fff;">Let's Talk</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Our Architectural Vision</h2>
            <p>A high-performance creative agency dedicated to completely redefining your brand's virtual presence.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p>At Dev Labs, we believe standard templates destroy corporate value. In an era where everyone uses basic alignments, your business needs an identity that instantly demands absolute authority.</p>
                <p>We treat web layout design as architectural science. Every micro-interaction, particle speed, and responsive system is optimized to guarantee lightning-fast rendering speeds, deep visual engagement, and extreme cross-browser compatibility.</p>
                <div class="tech-stack">
                    <h4 style="color:#fff; font-size:0.9rem; letter-spacing:1px;">OUR BATTLE-TESTED TECH MATRIX:</h4>
                    <div class="tech-badges">
                        <span class="badge">HTML5/CSS3 Spatial</span>
                        <span class="badge">Vanilla ES6+ JavaScript</span>
                        <span class="badge">WebGL Core Rendering</span>
                        <span class="badge">Hardware Accelerated CSS</span>
                        <span class="badge">Enterprise SEO Architecture</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stats">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h3 class="stat-count" data-target="99" data-suffix="%">0%</h3>
                    <p>System Conversion Precision</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h3 class="stat-count" data-target="150" data-suffix="+">0+</h3>
                    <p>Global Digital Pipelines</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h3 class="stat-count" data-target="3" data-suffix="X">0X</h3>
                    <p>User Engagement Multiplier</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h3 class="stat-count" data-target="24" data-suffix="/7">0/7</h3>
                    <p>Server-Side Support</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="process">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>The Structural Workflow</h2>
            <p>How our elite development squad translates your complex visions into fully operational web ecosystems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-flow">
            <div class="process-step">
                <span class="step-num">01</span>
                <h4>Discovery & Audit</h4>
                <p>We analyze your direct market competitors, define targeted user flows, and structure optimal system requirements.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="process-step">
                <span class="step-num">02</span>
                <h4>Interactive Design</h4>
                <p>Our engineers sketch high-fidelity custom prototypes focused on 3D depth, glowing accents, and fluid layouts.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="process-step">
                <span class="step-num">03</span>
                <h4>Production Code</h4>
                <p>We build using lightweight vanilla scripts ensuring clean semantics, zero bloatware, and maximum security.</p>
            </div>
